Package: printer-driver-di1610
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups
Description: CUPS driver for the KONICA MINOLTA (Minolta) Dialta Di1610
 Unofficial driver for the Di1610, a host-based GDI laser printer/copier for
 which the manufacturer never released a Linux driver. The KM4 protocol was
 reverse-engineered from the Windows driver.
 .
 Includes the rastertokm4 CUPS filter (halftone, JBIG1 compression, KM4
 framing), the PPD and a CUPS USB quirk that disables the back channel the
 printer cannot handle. A4 only, 600 and 300 dpi; the scanner is not supported.
